    ISSUE["後続対応: Issue-002<br/>artifact://example/issues/002<br/>現行参照・説明用"]
    D_release -->|判断の正本| ADR
    D_release -->|実装対象| SOURCE
    D_release -->|補助機能の後続対応| ISSUE
    D_release -->|実施結果| I_release
    R_keep -->|保持対象| I_release
